  "notes": [
    "Four rate tables: 指数なし (param prefix kihon) and 指数あり (prefix shisu), each for 確定年金 (fixed-term) and 年金総額保証付終身年金 (whole-life with total-payout guarantee). Per the brochure (brochure_ppartner_hanyo, 2026年4月版), 指数あり is the 指数連動部分付年金特則: a 定額部分 annuity plus a 上乗せ部分 that grows with the rise of a 参照指数 (連動率 USD/AUD 100%, JPY 30%) and never falls; the 指数あり plans therefore carry product_type indexed_annuity, the 指数なし plans the product's fixed_annuity.",
    "Grid encoding (changed 2026-11-17; earlier files kept these in age_band as codes): for the 確定年金 plans the plan key carries the annuity payout period and the deferral period as the site bands them, e.g. kihon_kakutei_pay15-20_def5-6 (年金支払期間15・20年, 据置期間5～6年; pay25-40 stands for the site's 25・30・35・40年). For the 終身年金 plans the plan key carries the 年金総額保証割合 (g100, g110, g120) and age_band holds the 契約年齢 band as printed (40-64, 65-79, 80-90). term_years is blank throughout: the deferral is only published as a band (1～4年, 5～6年, 7～10年), never as one number of years, and the 終身年金 table has no deferral column, so these rates are on no tenor board. scripts/dfl.py builds the plan from each series' plan_base plus the column, and reports any column without a series.",
    "Plain-language: the product is a deferred annuity with a deferral of 1-10 years; the guarantee/crediting period is not a separate rate dimension on this page. Whether the published rate is a crediting rate or a payout-basis rate (予定利率) was not established from the page, only that it is the 積立利率 table.",
    "Editions share the policy form and rate page on the insurer's rate hub.",
    "MVA gap: the mva_rate series come from index_immediate_annuity_24_b, which the page itself labels 契約日が2026年3月31日以前 (contracts dated on or before 2026-03-31). The rate page also links a separate MVA page for contracts dated 2026-04-01 onward (index_immediate_annuity_24_b_01.html); it is not collected.",
    "Launch date: 2024-08-01, the sales start stated in the insurer's news release of 2024-07-30 (id=1044, 『プレミアパートナー』, 通貨指定型個人年金保険（24）). Retrieved 2026-11-17."
  ],
  "notes_en": [
    "Rate history starts on 1 August 2024 and covers USD, AUD and JPY.",
    "Four rate tables exist: with and without an index, each for a fixed-term annuity and a whole-life annuity with a total-payout guarantee. The with-index plans add a top-up that grows with a reference index, so they are classed as indexed annuities.",
    "Rates vary by payout period and by a deferral band such as 1 to 4 years, both shown in the plan name. Because the deferral is only given as a band, these rates have no single tenor and appear on no tenor board.",
    "Surrender-value adjustment rates are collected only for contracts dated on or before 31 March 2026; the later table is not collected.",
    "Premier Partner M and Anshin Yutori Nenkin share the same rates. Launched 1 August 2024 (insurer news release).",
    "The with-index and no-index plans are published on separate rate pages that show identical rates in every period held, so their series match."
  ],
